item.description:
Have you seen how reasoning levels for Qwen actually work? It's pretty funny, the level you select gets used to dynamically assemble a system prompt effectively telling it to "think carefully" huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3.8...
<img src="https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:kft6lu4trxowqmter2b6vg6z/bafkreifp2jb72dtmf6awjuhhgkayogaccqgbm3n54s3rdfiljn5667br7q" alt="{%- if resolved_reasoning_effort == 'xhigh' %}
        {%- set reasoning_instructions = 'Reasoning effort is set to xhigh. Please think carefully through the task, validate key assumptions, consider plausible alternatives, and prioritize correctness, consistency, and clarity in the final answer.' %}
    {%- elif resolved_reasoning_effort == 'low' %}
        {%- set reasoning_instructions = 'Reasoning effort is set to low. Keep your thinking brief and focused, moving directly to the conclusion without unnecessary elaboration.' %}
    {%- endif %}" style="max-width:100%;margin-top:8px;">

